<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ESS Technology started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ESS Technology started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of ESS Technology Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $40 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 29-5/8.</p>
</text>
